requirement SYS-SAMPLE-001
title: Acquire station sample
statement:
  The service shall acquire one complete station sample during each configured interval.
end requirement

requirement SENSOR-LEVEL-001
title: Measure water level
statement:
  The level-sensing unit shall measure water level to within 10 mm.
decomposes: SYS-SAMPLE-001
end requirement

requirement DATA-ARCHIVE-001
title: Archive station samples
statement:
  The service shall retain each complete station sample for at least 30 days.
decomposes: SYS-SAMPLE-001
end requirement
